    "turn_text": "Hi, I'm Caitlin, a podcast producer here at C-Span. This week on C-Span's afterwards podcast, Congressman Mark Green, Republican of Tennessee, discusses division in America and the advantages of putting others before self. Military Times Deputy Editor Leo Shane interviews him.",
