  {
    "episode_id": 90932,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/0/90932.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 12,
    "turn_text": "here. Talk to me, before we get into some of the details of this, talk to me about the team that is America right now, because you can get into this a lot in here, about building the best team, having everyone think of each other and get in that. How are we doing? Because some parts here, it's very hopeful. Some parts of this book, it's pretty bleak.",
