    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/0/90932.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 124,
    "turn_text": "Do you think you can keep the focus on Congress and ignore some of the outside voices? As you mentioned before, the social media pressure, there's outside groups and outside advocates. When push comes to shove, A lot of the anger is coming from the larger group and because they might not know people personally, they see views, they see those clips. So can you, I mean, is that enough to cut through some of that to just make sure that you are seeing your, I don't want to even say adversaries? The folks are debating on",
