    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/0/90932.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 130,
    "turn_text": "tour. No, but a friendly position. I mean, I'm thinking of Senator McCain. I'm thinking of a lot of the folks who have gotten Senator Romney, who's pretty well liked in general, but was lambasted as a Republican in name only because he there to reach across the aisle on occasions and there to not villainize the Democratic members. And there's certainly Democrats who do this too. How do you, again, we're back to those extremist voices. How do you be someone who reaches out and not get caught in the crossfire?",
