    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/0/90932.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 132,
    "turn_text": "Okay. Now you've got me wondering what you thought about Senator McCain and Senator Romney, though.",
